    {
      "title": "TCP Connection",
      "desc": "Establishes a reliable link",
      "detail": "HTTP runs on top of TCP. Before any page data moves, the laptop and the server open a connection to port 80 with a three-way handshake: SYN, SYN-ACK, ACK.",
