    {
      "title": "HTTP Exchange",
      "desc": "Request and response messages",
      "detail": "The browser sends a GET request with a Host header. The server answers 200 OK with the HTML in the body: 12.2 KB, too big for one packet, so TCP splits it into 9 segments of up to 1460 bytes (drawn here as one).",
